control: i0 = 0, n = rounds-1 (= xor19 vector 5, unpreloaded answer)
control: i0 = 0, n = 63
k=8: i 2^k-3 .. 2^k+2, the 8-bit carry at iteration 3
k=12: i 2^k-3 .. 2^k+2, the 12-bit carry at iteration 3
k=16: i 2^k-3 .. 2^k+2, the 16-bit carry at iteration 3
k=24: i 2^k-3 .. 2^k+2, the 24-bit carry at iteration 3
k=30: i 2^k-3 .. 2^k+2, the 30-bit carry at iteration 3
k=31: i 2^31-3, 2^31-2 (the C's int cannot go further: the 31-bit carry is never needed)
wrap: i -3 .. 2, the 32-bit carry -1 -> 0 (longest chain of the adder)
k=30 long: 81 iterations across the 30-bit carry
k=24 first-iteration carry: i0 = 2^24-1 (entry value, then 2^24, 2^24+1)
k=30: i0 = 2^30-2 (carry at iteration 2)
